# =============================================================================
# Venture Investment Research Engine
# =============================================================================
#
# This application requires NO environment variables.
#
# There are no API keys, no tokens, and no credentials, because there are no
# external services to authenticate to. The site is fully static: the research
# corpus is bundled, and all workflow state lives in the visitor's browser.
#
# This file exists to make that explicit. If it ever gains a real variable,
# copy it to .env.local and never commit the copy. Every .env file is
# gitignored; only this template is tracked.
